Package: com.wmua1.myjb.checkm8
Name: myJB Loader (checkm8)
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: myJB container loader (checkm8: palera1n 15+, checkra1n 12-14)
 Installs myjb_loader.dylib into the tweak injection directory (ElleKit
 /var/jb rootless, or /Library/MobileSubstrate/DynamicLibraries and
 /usr/lib/TweakInject on rootful bootstrap like checkra1n 0.12.4b), so
 that .myjb containers are decrypted and loaded in every process. Creates
 the container/staging directories and generates the device key (kdev).
 Respring after installing.
Maintainer: wmua1
Author: wmua1
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 12.0)
Tag: purpose::extension
